    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Grasping plants fill a 20-ft square (difficult terrain). Creatures other than you in it make a STR save or are Restrained until the spell ends. A Restrained creature can use an action to make a STR (Athletics) check against your spell save DC, freeing itself on a success.</p>",
